                <pb facs="0846" n="770" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg770"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5431/256: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-10-26T13:00:00-05:00">October 26, 1935—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>67. Your 43, October 26, 11 a.m. Reworded proposals together with added
                    concessions have distinctly bettered American offers on watches. Nef has
                    probably reassured Stucki on this point. Swiss watch specialist, who left
                    yesterday on the <hi rendition="#italic">Bremen</hi>, declared he would explain
                    the nature and value of our concessions to Swiss industry.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
